@bank all
// Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): Mail from friends on the day you're promoted (seat C2 / social: friends and close
// friends send one, Day 10). "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender). Up to 400.
== mail.promo.friend
? tier=friend
- Officer! | Heard the news. Officer {me}. It suits you. Drinks are on you, I think that's the rule.   #funny
- Well done | Well done, you. Properly. Come and find me when you've settled in.   #warm
- Your own cabin | Your own cabin. Your own door. Can I come and look at it? I'm coming to look at it.
? tier=close
- Told you so | I said you'd be an officer before the month was out. I was right. I'm always right. Well done.   #warm
- So proud | I know you'll be busy now. Don't you dare get too busy for tea. Congratulations, {nick}.   #warm
